"Here you can enter your contact's phone numbers. As well as land-lines and "
"mobile/cell number, Fax, ISDN and many other types are possible. The number "
"can contain almost any character, so it is possible to format the number in "
"any way you need, including adding letters."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If three numbers aren't enough, simply press the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> "
"button to get additional fields to enter a number."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the type of the number is either a Phone, Mobile phone or Fax number you "
"can select a script to be executed when clicking on it. (under Configuration "
"→ General)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can enter your contact's addresses. You can do so by pressing the "
"<guibutton>Edit Addresses...</guibutton> Button and simply enter the "
"<guilabel>Street</guilabel>, <guilabel>Post Office Box</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Locality</guilabel>, <guilabel>Postal Code</guilabel>, and "
"<guilabel>Country</guilabel>. After you do so you can look up the address on "
"the map by simply clicking on the address (you can change the map-service/"
"string used by &kaddressbook; in its settings)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also create a label, which will be shown instead of the real address "
"(however, the map lookup, will use the real address)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also have set different addresses (i.e. one for work and one for "
"home). It's also possible to set two different <guilabel>Home</guilabel> "
"addresses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emails"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter email addresses for your contact here. You can set one address "
"as standard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you set a photo for your contact on the <guilabel>Misc</guilabel> tab, "
"&kmail; will show it when viewing these addresses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These addresses will be used in &kmail; if you type the name of the person "
"in either the <guilabel>To</guilabel>, <guilabel>CC</guilabel> or "
"<guilabel>BCC</guilabel> field of a new message."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid "Instant Messaging"
msgstr "ការ​ផ្ញើ​សារ​បន្ទាន់​"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>IM Address</guilabel> text box holds the preferred Instant "
#| "Messaging Address for this contact. To add, view and edit additional IM "
#| "Addresses, click the <guilabel>Edit IM Addresses...</guilabel> button. "
#| "The Edit IM Addresses Dialog appears."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>IM Address</guilabel> text box holds the preferred Instant "
"Messaging Address for this contact. To add, view and edit additional IM "
"Addresses, click the <guibutton>Edit IM Addresses...</guibutton> button. The "
"<guilabel>Edit Instant Messaging Address</guilabel> dialog appears."
msgstr ""
"ប្រអប់​អត្ថបទ <guilabel>អាសយដ្ឋាន IM</guilabel> ផ្ទុក​អាសយដ្ឋាន​សារ​បន្ទាន់​​សំណព្វ​សម្រាប់​"
"ទំនាក់ទំនង​នេះ ។ ដើម្បី​បន្ថែម មើល និង​កែសម្រួល​អាសយដ្ឋាន IM បន្ថែម គឺ​ត្រូវ​ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង "
"<guilabel>កែសម្រួល​អាសយដ្ឋាន IM...</guilabel> ។ ប្រអប់​កែសម្រួល​អាសយដ្ឋាន IM នឹង​លេចឡើង ។"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Edit IM Addresses Dialog"
msgstr "ប្រអប់​កែសម្រួល​អាសយដ្ឋាន IM"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Edit IM Addresses Dialog.</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>ប្រអប់​កែសម្រួល​អាសយដ្ឋាន IM ។</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Edit IM Addresses Dialog.</para>"
msgstr "<para>ប្រអប់​កែសម្រួល​អាសយដ្ឋាន IM ។</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A contact can have multiple instant messaging addresses associated with it. "
"Other applications, which are using the <application>Kimproxy</application> "
"system, such as &kopete; or &konversation; can interact using this "
"information. So in example you can associate a contact in IRC with a contact "
"in your address book. This cannot be done automatically, you have to make "
"this association manually in the specific program."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are not interest in whether they are picked up in another "
"application, and just want to store the instant messaging addresses with the "
"contact, then it's fine to add and edit them here. Otherwise it's "
"recommended that you let the applications do the changes and not yourself, "
"to not interfere with them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:378
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "For more information on adding new Instant Messaging Addresses, see "
#| "<ulink url=\"help:/kopete/getting-started.html#creating-accounts"
#| "\"><application>Kopete</application>'s handbook</ulink> and <ulink url="
#| "\"help:/konversation/linkaddressbook.html\"><application>Konversation</"
#| "application>'s handbook</ulink>."
msgid ""
"For more information on adding new Instant Messaging Addresses, see <ulink "
"url=\"help:/kopete/getting-started.html#creating-accounts\">&kopete;'s "
"handbook</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/konversation/linkaddressbook.html"
"\">&konversation;'s handbook</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"ចំពោះ​ព័ត៌មាន​បន្ថែម​អំពី​ការ​បន្ថែម​អាសយដ្ឋាន​សារ​បន្ទាន់​ថ្មី សូម​មើល <ulink url=\"help:/kopete/"
"getting-started.html#creating-accounts\">សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​របស់<application> Kopete</"
"application></ulink> និង <ulink url=\"help:/konversation/linkaddressbook.html"
"\">សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​របស់ <application>Konversation</application></ulink> ។"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Categories"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Categories help you to sort and group your contacts. You can simply add a "
"contact to one or more groups by pressing the <guibutton>Select Categories..."
"</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add your own category or remove an unused category you can click on "
"<guibutton>Edit Categories...</guibutton>. Here you can edit, add and remove "
"categories. Please notice that it is automatically started in Edit mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid "Public, Private and Confidental"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The three modes Public, Private and Confidental are part of the vCard "
"standard and implemented as such. These allow you another way to group your "
"contacts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid "Details tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the place where you can store additional details on your contacts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fields are mostly self-explanatory. You will notice that the "
"<guilabel>Anniversary</guilabel> and <guilabel>Birthday</guilabel> dates are "
"listed in the <guilabel>Special Dates</guilabel> list in the &kontact; "
"summary."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:404
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crypto Settings tab"
msgstr "ផ្ទាំង​ការ​កំណត់ Crypto"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In this tab, you can define preferences with regards to cryptography for "
#| "a contact. At the time of this writing, only <application>KMail</"
#| "application> will make use of these preferences when composing messages. "
#| "This mechanism replaces the barely editable per-recipient crypto "
#| "preferences of earlier <application>KMail</application> releases."
msgid ""
"In this tab, you can define preferences with regards to cryptography for a "
"contact. At the time of this writing, only &kmail; and &kontact; will make "
"use of these preferences when composing messages. This mechanism replaces "
"the barely editable per-recipient crypto preferences of earlier &kmail; "
"releases."
msgstr ""
"ក្នុង​ផ្ទាំងនេះ អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​ចំណង់ចំណូលចិត្ត​ដែល​ទាក់ទង​ទៅនឹង​ការ​គ្រីប​សម្រាប់​ទំនាក់ទំនង ។ នៅពេល​ការ​សរសេរ​"
"នេះ គឺមានតែ <application>KMail</application> ប៉ុណ្ណោះ​ដែល​នឹង​ធ្វើការ​ប្រើប្រាស់​ចំណង់ចំណូលចិត្ត​"
"ទាំងនេះ​នៅពេល​កំពុង​តែង​សារ ។ យន្តការ​នេះ​ជំនួស​ចំណង់ចំណូលចិត្ត​គ្រីប​ដែល​ស្ទើរតែ​អាច​កែសម្រួល​បាន​ក្នុង​អ្នក​ទទួល​"
"ម្នាក់​នៃការ​ចេញ​ផ្សាយ <application>KMail</application> ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allowed Protocols"
msgstr "ពិធីការ​ដែល​បាន​អនុញ្ញាត"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:419
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Here, you can restrict the cryptographic message formats that can be used "
#| "for this contact. See the section on <ulink url=\"/kmail/the-composer-"
#| "window.html#cryptographic-message-formats\">Cryptographic Message "
#| "Formats</ulink> in <ulink url=\"/kmail/\"><application>KMail</"
#| "application>'s handbook</ulink> for a discussion of the different "
#| "available formats."
msgid ""
"Here, you can restrict the cryptographic message formats that can be used "
"for this contact. See the section on <ulink url=\"/kmail/the-composer-window."
"html#cryptographic-message-formats\">Cryptographic Message Formats</ulink> "
"in <ulink url=\"/kmail/\">&kmail;'s handbook</ulink> for a discussion of the "
"different available formats."
msgstr ""
"នៅទីនេះ អ្នក​អាច​ដាក់​កម្រិត​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​សារ​គ្រីប ដេល​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់​ទំនាក់ទំនង​នេះ ។ សូមមើល​ផ្នែក​"
"នៅលើ <ulink url=\"/kmail/the-composer-window.html#cryptographic-message-"
"formats\">ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​សារ​គ្រីប</ulink> នៅ​ក្នុង​ <ulink url=\"/kmail/\">សៀវភៅ​ដៃ​របស់ "
"<application>KMail</application></ulink> សម្រាប់​ការ​ពិភាក្សា​នៃ​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ​ដែល​មាន​"
"ផ្សេងគ្នា ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:432
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<guilabel>Preferred OpenPGP encryption key</guilabel>, "
#| "<guilabel>Preferred S/MIME encryption certificate</guilabel>"
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Preferred OpenPGP encryption key</guilabel>, <guilabel>Preferred "
"&smime; encryption certificate</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>គ្រាប់ចុច​ការ​គ្រីប OpenPGP សំណព្វ</guilabel> <guilabel>វិញ្ញា​បនបត្រ​ការ​គ្រីប S/"
"MIME សំណព្វ</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:437
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Here, you can assign a preferred OpenPGP key and/or S/MIME certificate to "
#| "be used when encrypting to this contact. Otherwise, the local keyring and "
#| "local certificate box are searched for matching keys and certificates."
msgid ""
"Here, you can assign a preferred OpenPGP key and/or &smime; certificate to "
"be used when encrypting to this contact. Otherwise, the local keyring and "
"local certificate box are searched for matching keys and certificates."
msgstr ""
"នៅទីនេះ អ្នក​អាច​កំណត់​កូនសោ OpenPGP សំណព្វ និង​/​ឬ​វិញ្ញាបនបត្រ S/MIME ដើម្បី​ប្រើ​នៅពេល​ធ្វើការ​"
"អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ទៅ​ទំនាក់ទំនង​នេះ ។ បើ​មិន​ដូច្នោះ​ទេ​ប្រអប់ keyring មូលដ្ឋាន និង​វិញ្ញាបនបត្រ​មូលដ្ឋាន​​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​"
"ស្វែងរក​កូនសោ និង​វិញ្ញាបនបត្រ​ដែល​ផ្គូផ្គង ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "Message Preference"
msgstr "ចំណង់​ចំណូល​ចិត្ត​សារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here, you can select from a set of directives for user interaction both when "
"signing and when encrypting."
msgstr ""
"នៅទីនេះ អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ពី​សំណុំ​នៃ​សេចក្ដី​​បង្គាប់​សម្រាប់​អន្តរសកម្ម​ ទាំង​នៅពេល​ចុះហត្ថលេខា និង​នៅពេល​"
"អ៊ិនគ្រីប ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid "&lt;none&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;គ្មាន&gt;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:461
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "No preference, use whatever mode <application>KMail</application> "
#| "defaults to."
msgid "No preference, use whatever mode &kmail; defaults to."
msgstr ""
"គ្មាន​ចំណង់ចំណូល​ចិត្ត ប្រើ​របៀប​អ្វី​ក៏ដោយ ដើម្បី​កំណត់ <application>KMail</application> លំនាំដើម ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Never Sign</guilabel>, <guilabel>Never Encrypt</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>កុំ​ចុះហត្ថលេខា</guilabel> <guilabel>កុំ​អ៊ិនគ្រីប</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Never sign (encrypt) messages to this contact. Don't ask for confirmation "
"(except in the case of conflicts with preferences of other contacts)."
msgstr ""
"កុំ​ចុះហត្ថលេខា (អ៊ិនគ្រីប) សារ​ទៅ​ទំនាក់​ទំនាង​នេះ ។ កុំ​សួររក​ការ​អះអាង (លើកលែង​តែ​ក្នុង​ករណី​ដែល​មាន​ការ​"
"ប៉ះទង្គិច​ជាមួយ​ចំណង់​ចំណូល​ចិត្ត​របស់​ទំនាក់ទំនង​ផ្សេងទៀត) ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Always Sign</guilabel>, <guilabel>Always Encrypt</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>ចុះហត្ថលេខា​ជានិច្ច</guilabel> <guilabel>អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ជានិច្ច</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Always sign (encrypt) messages to the contact. Don't ask for confirmation "
"(except in the case of conflicts with preferences of other contacts)."
msgstr ""
"ចុះហត្ថលេខា (អ៊ីនគ្រីប) សារ​ទៅ​ទំនាក់ទំនង ។ កុំសួរ​រក​ការ​អះអាង (លើកលែងតែ​ក្នុង​ករណី​ដែល​ប៉ះទង្គិច​ជាមួយ​"
"ចំណង់​ចំណូលចិត្ត​របស់​ទំនាក់ទំនង​ផ្សេងទៀត) ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Always Sign If Possible</guilabel>, <guilabel>Always Encrypt If "
"Possible</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>ចុះហត្ថលេខា​ជានិច្ច​បើ​អាច​ធ្វើបាន</guilabel>, <guilabel>អ៊ិនគ្រីប​ជានិច្ច​បើ​អាច​"
"ធ្វើបាន</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:500
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Always sign (encrypt) messages to this contact when it would be possible "
#| "to do so. Don't ask if it isn't possible. Situations in which signing "
#| "might not be possible include other recipients having signing preferences "
#| "of \"Never\". Situations in which encryption might not be possible "
#| "include missing keys/certificates for this or other recievers."
msgid ""
"Always sign (encrypt) messages to this contact when it would be possible to "
"do so. Don't ask if it isn't possible. Situations in which signing might not "
"be possible include other recipients having signing preferences of \"Never"
"\". Situations in which encryption might not be possible include missing "
"keys/certificates for this or other receivers."
msgstr ""
"ចុះហត្ថលេខា (អ៊ិនគ្រីប) សារ​ជានិច្ច​ទៅ​ទំនាក់ទំនង​នេះ នៅពេល​ដែល​វា​នឹង​អាច​ធ្វើ​ដូចនេះ​បាន ។ កុំ​សួរ​ថាតើ​វា​"
"អាច​​ឬ​ក៏​អត់​នោះ ។ ស្ថានភាព​ដែល​ការ​ចុះហត្ថលេខា​មិនអាច​ធ្វើបាន​នោះ គឺ​រួមមាន​អ្នក​ទទួល​ផ្សេងទៀត​ដែល​មាន​"
"ចំណង់​ចំណូលចិត្ត​ចុះហត្ថលេខានៃ \"កុំ\" ។ ស្ថានភាព​ដែល​ការ​អ៊ិនគ្រីប​មិនអាច​ធ្វើបាន រួម​មាន​កូនសោ​/​"
"វិញ្ញាបនបត្រ​ដែល​បាត់​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​ទទួល​នេះ ឬ​ផ្សេងទៀត ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
